  "details": "In VRChat 2025.4.1 and earlier, the \"VRC+\" text used to be legible in the shop. It was replaced in VRChat 2025.4.2 (Build 1768) with a logo image that becomes illegible at lower resolutions, such as the default 1024x768 resolution for first time VRChat users.\n\n1. Set resolution to 1024x768 in Graphics settings.\n\n2. Open shop.\n\n3. Notice how small text is legible for discounted prices, but the VRC+ logo isn't.",
